This Watch Strap is made of the most qualitative part of the leather. This full grain cognac leather is an Italian hide from the Badalassi Carlo Tannery.

It has a white thread and black is used for the accent colour on the edges and the hardware (buckles). It has been made compatible with iWatch but is totally adjustable for more classical ways to attach it.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

